#: profileracoonoptionsbase4.ui:303
msgctxt "Automatic keying has a property called perfect forward secrecy. This is the Diffie Hellman group for PFS."
msgid "Diffie Hellman group for Perfect Forward Secrecy"
msgstr "Diffie-Hellman-Koppel för utwarkenfree Verslöteln"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, PerfectForwardSecrecyCombobox)
#. +> trunk
#: advancedprofiledialogbase4.ui:106 newprofilewizardracoon4.ui:315
#: profileciscooptionsbase4.ui:442 profileipsecoptionsbase4.ui:171
#: profileracoonoptionsbase4.ui:317
msgid ""
"This is the Diffie Hellman group for PFS.\n"
"The following assignment will is used:\n"
"server = DH group is received from server (cisco only)\n"
"nopfs = no pfs is used\n"
"dh1 = modp768\n"
"dh2 = modp1024\n"
"dh5 = modp1536\n"
"d14 = modp2048 (racoon only)\n"
"dh15= modp3072 (racoon only)\n"
"dh16 = modp4096 (racoon only)\n"
"dh17 = modp6144 (racoon only)\n"
"dh18 = modp8192 (racoon only)"
msgstr ""
"Dit is de Diffie-Hellman-Koppel för UFV.\n"
"Disse Towiesen warrt bruukt:\n"
"server = DH-Koppel warrt vun'n Server haalt (bloots Cisco)\n"
"nopfs = keen UFV bruukt\n"
"dh1 = modp768\n"
"dh2 = modp1024\n"
"dh5 = modp1536\n"
"d14 = modp2048 (bloots Racoon)\n"
"dh15= modp3072 (bloots Racoon)\n"
"dh16 = modp4096 (bloots Racoon)\n"
"dh17 = modp6144 (bloots Racoon)\n"
"dh18 = modp8192 (bloots Racoon)"

